{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"左手像心跳，身体仿佛可以交给船底托举，水却一直在流\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"右手两条旋律线贴得很近，像肩膀挨着肩膀，连呼吸和体温都融在一处\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"text\": \"水波还在晃，流动却像被水下暗流拖住，思绪像被风吹碎的倒影，闪烁却难拼完整\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"text\": \"熟悉的歌声又回来，两道声线仍贴耳低语，这一遍却更华丽、更迫切\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-6\",\n      \"text\": \"两道声线仍贴得那么近，左手水波却一直向前，仿佛每一秒都在倒数；还没有失去什么，就已经舍不得\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"text\": \"原来一直托着人的水波和摇晃忽然像被抽掉，只剩一条单薄旋律\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"text\": \"刚才还像两个人贴近耳语，交谈却戛然而止；心里闪过一句：这份幸福真实吗？\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"text\": \"此前那阵想攥紧不放的冲动，到了这里却像音乐自己松开了手\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"text\": \"白天和某个人相处得很好，独处时心头却泛酸\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"独自回想一段关系，气味、身体感觉、幻想、遗憾和快感混在一起；明知正被卷进去，却暂时不想出来\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"text\": \"美也没有消失；可你已经听见时间正在经过，这一刻纵然完美，也没有办法让它停住\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"text\": \"身体恢复弹性，带一点玩心和调情般的回应\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-5\",\n      \"text\": \"不安还没回答，却暂时不占满心思\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"text\": \"船的摇荡仿佛被清风拨开，时间松出一小块空地；身体也像失去重量，短暂悬在夏夜微风里\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"text\": \"右手高音区织出极细、极亮的小音符\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"text\": \"前面悬置的期待似乎终于得到满足，但还不是结束\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"那支温柔晴朗的歌在这里被放到开阔的尺度，内声部彼此拉扯，一浪高过一浪\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"这份狂喜像高烧，也像久别重逢：忽然抱紧对方，久久不愿松手\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"text\": \"歌声带上近乎恳求的力量，一次次向上伸展，却始终不能完全满足\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"text\": \"进入终结句才真正松下来、轻下来，心里仍温热，身体慢慢平静\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"text\": \"尾声像隔着很远回应开头\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"text\": \"最后几下和弦干脆沉重，低音像铁锚落入水底，把摇荡的小船定住\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ad0d2035-a6fd-438b-961a-9cac9dec61ce", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T045405356790Z", "elapsed_seconds": 168.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T04:56:53.660340+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "78d8db18ffb50bbd075c8c8bff282f9523699620bbf01ac3f33be2afd6b485b4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T045405356790Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "4a1fac007c8956be50d14a4eca3331e67f6d49379123d1494ecd